<h2>FAQ</h2>
<div class="card">
  <h3>Will my account get banned?</h3>
  <p>Possible but not common. altkey forwards the request from the same browser fingerprint you captured (UA + Accept-Language), throttles concurrent in-flight requests, and prefers Worker PoPs near your likely region. We've seen sub-2% ban rates in private alpha. Use at your own risk.</p>

  <h3>Why not just use the official APIs?</h3>
  <p>Because you're already paying $20/mo for Pro/Plus/Advanced and the official APIs charge per token on top. altkey makes the subscription you already pay for usable from your tools.</p>

  <h3>What happens if you shut down?</h3>
  <p>The OSS self-host version (<a href="https://github.com/SenGuru/altkey">github.com/SenGuru/altkey</a>) keeps working forever on your own machine. We'll announce shutdowns 30 days ahead and pro-rate refunds.</p>

  <h3>Why no email signup?</h3>
  <p>Because email is what regulators subpoena. We don't collect PII so there's nothing to surrender. Account = ULID + passphrase + recovery code.</p>
</div>

<p class="sub" style="margin-top:48px;font-size:13px;">altkey is operated as a personal project by an independent developer. Not affiliated with Anthropic, OpenAI, or Google. <a href="/canary.txt">Warrant canary</a>.</p>

</div>
